# Same allow-list as deploy/Dockerfile.dockerignore. BuildKit reads that file; kaniko (the GitLab build job) only
# reads .dockerignore at the context root - without this file kaniko would send results/, .venv and adapters/ along.
**
!deploy/requirements-runtime.txt
!deploy/Dockerfile
!ttg/**
!data/policies/**
!vlm/**
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
